+# Hostile file fuzzing
+
+Install cargo-fuzz and a nightly Rust toolchain, then run from this folder:
+
+```sh
+cargo +nightly fuzz run hostile_files -- -max_len=1048576 -timeout=10 -rss_limit_mb=2048
+```
+
+Seed corpus with synthetic BIMCraft JSON, IFC STEP and CFB headers. Never commit proprietary Revit files. This target covers project/IFC decoding and Revit container construction and gzip member inflation, not full Revit import or every parser path. Run in an isolated worker with CPU/memory/time limits; size limits alone do not bound algorithmic complexity. Preserve minimized crashes as regression fixtures.
